menu "MooBot Gemini"

    config MOO_GEMINI_API_KEY
        string "Gemini API key"
        default ""
        help
            From aistudio.google.com/apikey. Empty = stories disabled.

            This lands in firmware/sdkconfig, which .gitignore already
            excludes — same handling as the Google OAuth client secret.

            It is still readable by anyone who dumps the flash. Fine for a
            unit on your desk; for anything you hand out, proxy Gemini
            through your own backend and give devices a revocable token.

    config MOO_GEMINI_MODEL
        string "Model that hears the request and writes the story"
        default "gemini-flash-latest"
        help
            Takes the recorded audio directly — no separate speech-to-text
            service is involved.

            Deliberately the "-latest" alias rather than a pinned version.
            Google retires specific versions to new users (gemini-2.5-flash
            already 404s with "no longer available to new users"), and on a
            device a stale model name costs a reflash to fix.

    config MOO_GEMINI_TTS_MODEL
        string "Model that speaks the story"
        default "gemini-2.5-flash-preview-tts"
        help
            Returns raw 24 kHz 16-bit mono PCM, which is what the speaker
            wants. Do not point this at a model that returns MP3 — there is
            no decoder on the device.

            gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview is the newer alternative; both were
            verified returning 24 kHz mono L16. Swap and judge by ear.
            There is no "-latest" alias for TTS, so this one will eventually
            need updating by hand.

    config MOO_GEMINI_VOICE
        string "Prebuilt voice name"
        default "Puck"
        help
            Puck, Kore, Charon, Fenrir, Aoede and others. Puck is bright
            and works well for a children's story.

    config MOO_GEMINI_LANG
        string "Language to tell stories in"
        default "Marathi"
        help
            Plain English name of the language, dropped into the prompt.
            Gemini 2.5 TTS speaks 24 languages including Marathi, Hindi,
            Bengali, Tamil and Telugu.

    config MOO_GEMINI_MAX_WORDS
        int "Story length cap (words)"
        range 20 300
        default 90
        help
            Each word costs speech time and download time. 90 words is
            roughly 40 seconds spoken — about the ceiling of an 18-month
            old's attention.

endmenu
